<%- include('partials/head') %>

<div class="container narrow">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Blue-collar jobs, nothing hidden</h1>
    <p>
      Karmaadhar Jobs exists because finding work as a delivery rider, driver, guard, cook or
      electrician should not depend on knowing someone. Every listing shows the monthly salary, the
      area, the experience needed and the qualification required before you apply.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>For job seekers</h2>
    <p>
      Pick your city, tap a category like <a href="/?category=Delivery">delivery</a> or
      <a href="/?category=Security%20Guard">security</a>, and apply with your name and mobile
      number. No account, no resume upload, no registration fee. Freshers are welcome — use the
      <a href="/?experience=Fresher">fresher jobs</a> filter.
    </p>

    <h2>For employers</h2>
    <p>
      Post a job from the <a href="/post">post a job</a> page in two minutes. Listings publish
      immediately and are visible to candidates browsing by category, city, experience and job type.
      Always mention the monthly salary — workers skip listings that hide pay.
    </p>

    <h2>How the data works</h2>
    <p>
      Listings and applications are stored by this application itself, on durable storage, so they
      survive restarts. The jobs feed is also available as JSON at
      <a href="/api/jobs">/api/jobs</a>.
    </p>

    <ul class="stats stats--inline stats--light">
      <li><strong><%= stats.jobs %></strong><span>jobs hiring</span></li>
      <li><strong><%= stats.companies %></strong><span>employers</span></li>
      <li><strong><%= stats.cities %></strong><span>cities</span></li>
      <li><strong><%= stats.applications %></strong><span>applications</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
